  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Center for Culture and Development (DCCD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CKU mainly works within three strategic areas:
1) The Center will help to create a continuing interest and respect in Denmark for art and culture from developing countries (this occurs primarily in the context of the Images festivals and the Youth Program), 2) The Center will work with cultural exchange and dialogue to promote mutual understanding, inspiration and enrichment (this occurs primarily in the context of the Art Fund) and, 3) the Center will contribute to a deliberate and systematic incorporation of culture in Danish development cooperation, including support for the implementation of development activities (this occurs primarily within the framework of cultural cooperation agreements with Danish representations in developing countries).</narrative>
  </description>
